{
  "name": "Throw Bomb",
  "type": "feature",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Mark a Stress</strong> to throw a bomb at a point within Close range, which explodes and fills the air within Very Close range:</p><ul><li><p><em><strong>Smoke.</strong></em> All targets within the area are <em>Dizzied</em>. <em>Dizzied</em> targets have disadvantage on their next action roll, then clear the condition.</p></li><li><p><em><strong>Fire.</strong></em> All targets within the area take <strong>4d8+3</strong> direct physical damage and are lit <em>On Fire</em> until they are doused or put out the fire with a successful Finesse roll. When a creature acts while <em>On Fire</em> they must take an extra <strong>3d8</strong> direct physical damage if they are still <em>On Fire</em> at the end of their action.</p></li><li><p><em><strong>Glue.</strong></em> All targets within the area must succeed on an Agility reaction roll or be <em>Restrained</em> by glue until freed with a successful Finesse or Strength Roll.</p></li></ul>",
